Copyright 2026 hana-powercontext contributors

This product includes software developed as part of the hana-powercontext
project (https://github.com/SeptTpes/hana-powercontext).

This product integrates with, and depends on at runtime, the following
third-party software:

* PowerContext
  Copyright OceanBase (https://github.com/oceanbase/powercontext)
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
  hana-powercontext is an independent HanaAgent (openhanako) integration for
  PowerContext. It communicates with a separately-installed PowerContext
  Server over HTTP and contains no PowerContext source code.

* Reference implementation acknowledgement
  The integration contract (pre-step recall, pc_* tool semantics, fail-open
  behaviour) follows the official PowerContext DSH integration
  (upstream `integrations/dsh`), vendored during development as
  `artifacts/upstream-dsh-index.js` for contract verification only.

* HanaAgent / openhanako
  The host platform this App targets (https://github.com/liliMozi/openhanako),
  whose App SDK and documentation define the v2 App contract. hana-powercontext
  contains no openhanako source code.

